  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">此模組允許您在 RS2 內使用 EMC 進行自動合成</h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_41d805e4-f446-4211-9b02-74f92b4d88d0.png\" width=\"696\" height=\"364\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_42552a12-0ac4-434b-b4b4-285876a43986.png\" width=\"737\" height=\"431\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>支援</h2>\n<p>需要協助或有疑問嗎？歡迎加入我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/c9WpYQE3Vr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>！</p>\n<hr>\n<p>若您希望支持我及我的模組開發，建議您嘗試 BisectHosting。新用戶使用優惠碼「project8gbderam」可享首月遊戲伺服器 25% 折扣。他們提供全天候客服與極速回應，確保您的伺服器運作順暢，並為您的所有遊戲需求提供卓越的協助。&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/project8gbderam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/project8gbderam</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/54bb107c-f9fc-4f32-8515-fb4e3d56c124.png\" alt=\"Bisect\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>",
